      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427625
    m_Localized: 'Tutorial complete!

      Time to play!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427626
    m_Localized: Completed in AR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427627
    m_Localized: Deciphered - Go to AR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427628
    m_Localized: Ready to decipher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427629
    m_Localized: Locked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20525103427630
    m_Localized: Unknown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20793148813312
    m_Localized: 1. Hi! I'm Eliane Tremblay, and this is MY adventure at the house
      on Hollow Street. I'm going to teach you how to play, okay? Let's have a blast!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809600
    m_Localized: '2. This game uses Augmented Reality, which means we''ll see everything
      through your phone''s camera. It''s like opening a magic window into the story!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809601
    m_Localized: 3. Just a moment... I'm waking up the magic camera.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809602
    m_Localized: '4. This game works with special cards. You need to have them printed
      out, or on another screen. If you don''t have them yet, download them in thetremblay.com/downloads '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809603
    m_Localized: 5. Look for the 2  cards that say "TUTORIAL." Those are the ones
      we'll use now. Point your camera at one of them, like you're about to take
      its picture.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809604
    m_Localized: 6. Look! A candle <sprite name="vela"> or appeared on the card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809605
    m_Localized: 7. You can tap objects right on the screen when they appear. Try
      it! Tap the candle <sprite name="vela">.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809606
    m_Localized: 8. Did you hear how it's said in Spanish? If you want to hear it
      again, tap the button I'm pointing at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809607
    m_Localized: "9. You can listen to it as many times as you want \u2014 I did
      too when I was learning! Just tap the button again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809608
    m_Localized: 10. Now let's save this object so we can use it later. Tap the button
      I'm showing you to save it in your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809609
    m_Localized: 11. Awesome, it's yours now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809610
    m_Localized: '12. Now you can close it by tapping here. Remember: whenever you
      want to see an object again, just point the camera at it and tap it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809611
    m_Localized: 13. Go ahead and save the other object that appeared too.  Point
      your camera at the other card you found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809612
    m_Localized: 14. Hey, I see you found the pumpkin! <sprite name="calabaza"> It's
      one of my favorites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809613
    m_Localized: 15. Save it in your inventory, just like we did with the candle
      <sprite name="vela">.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809614
    m_Localized: "16. Perfect! Now close the panel \u2014 I want to show you something
      really important."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809615
    m_Localized: 17. See the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza"> down there? I'm pointing
      at it. You can tap it, or swipe up to open your inventory. Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809616
    m_Localized: '18. Look! Here are the two objects you saved: the candle <sprite
      name="vela"> and the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">. They''re both yours
      now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809617
    m_Localized: 19. Up top there's a mission. I know you might not fully understand
      what it says yet, but I bet you can guess which objects it's asking for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809618
    m_Localized: 20. Drag the candle <sprite name="vela"> to the spot where it belongs.
      If you don't remember how to say "candle <sprite name="vela">" tap the green
      button next to it to hear it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809619
    m_Localized: 21. That's how it's done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809620
    m_Localized: 22. Now drag the candle <sprite name="vela"> and the pumpkin <sprite
      name="calabaza">, each one to its place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809621
    m_Localized: 23. You're doing great! Now tap the button I'm pointing at to check
      if you placed them right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809622
    m_Localized: "24. Yesss! You just deciphered the mission. Can you guess what
      it says? Don't worry if not \u2014 you'll understand more words over time.
      For now, let's go complete it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809623
    m_Localized: 25. Let's actually bring the candle <sprite name="vela"> to the
      pumpkin now. But first, close the inventory by swiping down or tapping the
      button I'm pointing at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809624
    m_Localized: 26. Now scan the candle's <sprite name="vela"> card with your camera.
      Do you remember which one it is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809625
    m_Localized: 27. Did you see a hand appear? Tap it to grab the candle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809626
    m_Localized: 27a. close ncandle panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809627
    m_Localized: 28. The candle <sprite name="vela"> is with you now! Head over to
      the pumpkin's <sprite name="calabaza"> card and point at it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809628
    m_Localized: 29. A hand appeared here too, see it? That means you can drop the
      candle <sprite name="vela"> onto the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809629
    m_Localized: 30. Almost there. Now tap the button I'm pointing at to check that
      you brought what the mission needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809630
    m_Localized: '32. Do you know what the mission was asking for now? That''s right:
      put the candle <sprite name="vela"> inside the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">.
      I think you''re ready to play on your own. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809631
    m_Localized: 33. Almost forgot! See that green icon? Tap it to see all your missions.
      Right now there's only one, but once you start really playing, tons more will
      show up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809632
    m_Localized: "34. One more thing: missions change color depending on their status.
      \U0001F534 Red: not available yet. \U0001F535 Blue: ready for you to decipher.
      \U0001F7E1 Yellow: already deciphered, still need to complete them with the
      camera. \U0001F7E2 Green: completed!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809633
    m_Localized: 34a. close the mission list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20794918809634
    m_Localized: '35. That''s everything! Now go have fun and learn a bit of Spanish
      with me. See you in the game! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
